    "type": "game",
    "name": "Animal Game",
    "steam_appid": 1541160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Animal Game</strong> is a 3D monster collector RPG that parodies popular titles in the genre. <strong>Explore, collect and battle</strong> across huge biomes with over 100 unique <i>never-before-seen</i> <strong>Battle Buddies</strong>, like the mighty <strong>Bear</strong>, the clever <strong>Octopus</strong> or the intimidating <strong>Goose</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/20b685c4df11977ffd1a13f9b7156ad6.poster.avif?t=1747254985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/20b685c4df11977ffd1a13f9b7156ad6.webm?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Discover massive zones teeming with life - and plenty of bad guys! Whether you're a <strong>Desert</strong> dweller, a <strong>City</strong> slicker or a friend of the <strong>Forest</strong>, you'll feel right at home in this strange new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Wander off to find <strong>special items and Buddies</strong> by completing <strong>side quests</strong> - or tackle the main mission head on and defeat the <strong>Gang Galactic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/485895e8207e455ff167c2076189e9a8.poster.avif?t=1747254985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/485895e8207e455ff167c2076189e9a8.webm?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/485895e8207e455ff167c2076189e9a8.mp4?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981   <strong>Build a team of Battle Buddies</strong> that fit your preferred playstyle - or just fill your party with your favorite little guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981   Challenge yourself to catch <strong>over 100 unique Buddies,</strong> or hunt down the <strong>Special versions</strong> of each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981 Completionists will have plenty to work towards with dozens of <strong>side quests, hidden items and achievements</strong> to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/bc04d68bdd6d78339380ecf894cd44f4.poster.avif?t=1747254985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/bc04d68bdd6d78339380ecf894cd44f4.webm?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Focus on your team's synergies to take down the nefarious <strong>Gang Galactic</strong> in this dynamic <strong>double battle system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Innovative combat with abilities that <strong>power up</strong> <strong>each turn</strong>, but <strong>downgrade after use</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Manage your <strong>Stamina</strong> wisely to support your allies or set up devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981 Utilize <strong>Passive Traits, Equipped Items</strong> and well-timed <strong>abilities</strong> to take down tough bosses and clear challenging dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Discover a unique status effect system that encourages exciting strategies! Melt your enemies with <strong>Poison</strong>, outsmart your enemies with <strong>Stealth</strong>, or satisfy your bloodlust with a heavy-hitting <strong>Bleed</strong> team.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Animal Game</strong> is a 3D monster collector RPG that parodies popular titles in the genre. <strong>Explore, collect and battle</strong> across huge biomes with over 100 unique <i>never-before-seen</i> <strong>Battle Buddies</strong>, like the mighty <strong>Bear</strong>, the clever <strong>Octopus</strong> or the intimidating <strong>Goose</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/20b685c4df11977ffd1a13f9b7156ad6.poster.avif?t=1747254985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/20b685c4df11977ffd1a13f9b7156ad6.webm?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Discover massive zones teeming with life - and plenty of bad guys! Whether you're a <strong>Desert</strong> dweller, a <strong>City</strong> slicker or a friend of the <strong>Forest</strong>, you'll feel right at home in this strange new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Wander off to find <strong>special items and Buddies</strong> by completing <strong>side quests</strong> - or tackle the main mission head on and defeat the <strong>Gang Galactic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/485895e8207e455ff167c2076189e9a8.poster.avif?t=1747254985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/485895e8207e455ff167c2076189e9a8.webm?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/485895e8207e455ff167c2076189e9a8.mp4?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981   <strong>Build a team of Battle Buddies</strong> that fit your preferred playstyle - or just fill your party with your favorite little guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981   Challenge yourself to catch <strong>over 100 unique Buddies,</strong> or hunt down the <strong>Special versions</strong> of each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981 Completionists will have plenty to work towards with dozens of <strong>side quests, hidden items and achievements</strong> to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/bc04d68bdd6d78339380ecf894cd44f4.poster.avif?t=1747254985\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541160/extras/bc04d68bdd6d78339380ecf894cd44f4.webm?t=1747254985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Focus on your team's synergies to take down the nefarious <strong>Gang Galactic</strong> in this dynamic <strong>double battle system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Innovative combat with abilities that <strong>power up</strong> <strong>each turn</strong>, but <strong>downgrade after use</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Manage your <strong>Stamina</strong> wisely to support your allies or set up devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981 Utilize <strong>Passive Traits, Equipped Items</strong> and well-timed <strong>abilities</strong> to take down tough bosses and clear challenging dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981    Discover a unique status effect system that encourages exciting strategies! Melt your enemies with <strong>Poison</strong>, outsmart your enemies with <strong>Stealth</strong>, or satisfy your bloodlust with a heavy-hitting <strong>Bleed</strong> team.</p>",
    "short_description": "A 3D turn-based creature collector RPG where you catch and battle unimaginable creatures after being sent to a strange new world. Experience the full story mode as you fight through bad guys - and various bystanders - in a reimagined 2v2 battle system that adds new elements to classic RPG combat.",
